A line block in a description under a list item takes a lazy line after a definition-shaped payload

```
- :: u
  : ::: |
    [x]: /u
b

[x]
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>[x]: /u<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>[x]</p>
```

```
1. :: u
   : ::: |
     [^1]: n
b
.
<ol>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>[^1]: n<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ol>
```

```
- :: u
  :  ::: |
       [x]: /u "t"
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;[x]: /u “t”<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```
